 hygiene because the volume and rules are straightforward to document. Once accuracy is proven, pods usually absorb scheduling, client reporting and full onboarding packs."},{"question":"How do you prevent mistakes?","answer":"Every workflow has a written process map, a checklist and a quality reviewer. The first two weeks include daily spot checks against your samples, moving to weekly audits once accuracy targets are consistently met."},{"question":"Is admin support priced per task or per person?","answer":"Pricing is a fixed monthly retainer per dedicated administrator, agreed before onboarding begins. There is no per-task billing, so your costs stay flat while volumes fluctuate within the agreed scope."},{"question":"Will the pod work in our systems?","answer":"Yes. Administrators receive scoped access to your CRM, document tools and shared drives, with permissions limited to their role. We can also supply our own licences for standard tools if that is simpler for your IT team."},{"question":"What notice do you need to change pod size?","answer":"Two to three weeks is standard for scaling up or down, covering recruitment, training or structured handover. Detailed process maps are kept current, so continuity never depends on one person's memory."}]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"w-full py-space-3xl bg-surface","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin lg:px-margin-desktop space-y-space-2xl","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-space-md","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-space-xs max-w-xl","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-emerald-accent tracking-widest uppercase font-bold","children":"KEEP EXPLORING"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Related Services."}]]}],["$","$L2",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap